, "pic": {"large": "https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/m_ratio_poster/public/p2931089059.jpg", "normal": "https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2931089059.jpg"}, "rating": {"count": 702, "max": 10, "star_count": 4.0, "value": 8.2}, "tags": [], "title": "再见菈菈", "type": "tv", "uri": "douban://douban.com/tv/36901723", "vendor_count": 0, "vendor_icons": [], "year": "2026"}, {"card_subtitle": "2026 / 日本 / 动画 奇幻 / 吴珍九 / 子安武人 井上喜久子", "comment": "在深邃的森林深处，一只会喷火的龙，与一群能操纵魔法的猫咪一同生活着。\n这只在出生前便失去亲生父母的龙，被一只偶然相遇的母猫抚养长大。对猫咪们而言，它只是只能在天空飞翔、会吐出火焰的「有点特别的猫」，迎接进了家族之中。\n生活在森林中的猫咪们，各自拥有截然不同的个性与生活方式。龙仿佛是为了报答母猫的恩情，始终陪伴在森林里的猫咪们身边，并守护着它们。猫咪们亲昵地称呼它为「翅膀大叔」。\n而在人类眼中，这只龙则被敬畏地称为——猫龙……", "episodes_info": "", "has_linewatch": false, "honor_infos": [], "id": "37234138", "interest": null, "photos": [], "pic": {"large": "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/m_ratio_poster/public/p2932413304.jpg", "normal": "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2932413304.jpg"}, "rating": {"count": 506, "max": 10, "star_count": 4.0, "value": 8.1}, "tags": [], "title": "猫与龙", "type": "tv", "uri": "douban://douban.com/tv/37234138", "vendor_count": 0, "vendor_icons": [], "year": "2026"}, {"card_subtitle": "2026 / 中国大陆 / 剧情 喜剧 动作 动画 奇幻 / 苏晓光 / 马正阳", "comment": "为苍生大义，白小纯不得不与通天道人展开决战。随着旧世界破碎，众人流落天外的永恒大陆。而在这里白小纯将面对更严峻的挑战，更强大的敌人……", "episodes_info": "更新至3集", "has_linewatch": true, "honor_infos": [], "id": "37448094", "interest": null, "photos": ["https://img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2934304991.jpg", "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2934304982.jpg", "https://img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2934304951.jpg", "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2934304943.jpg"], "pic": {"large": "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/m_ratio_poster/public/p2934292395.jpg", "normal": "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2934292395.jpg"}, "rating": {"count": 0, "max": 10, "star_count": 0, "value": 0}, "tags": [], "title": "​一念永恒 完结季​", "t